name":"Snowball Effect","members":["Anastasya","Vesna","Odette","Vodyanitsa"],"text":"Anastasya’s Crown supplies Cryo and buffs Glimmer. Vesna drives Stellar Swirl; Odette boosts reactions and Vodyanitsa sustains.","roles":["Cryo Enabler / Buffer","On-field DPS","Cryo Enabler / Buffer","Healer / Buffer"]},{"name":"Cold as Ice","members":["Anastasya","Wriothesley","Furina","Escoffier"],"text":"Tap Skill for extra Cryo while Wriothesley stays on field. Furina buffs damage, and Escoffier heals and shreds Cryo/Hydro RES.","roles":["Off-field Cryo Enabler","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Buffer","Healer / Debuffer"]}],"v":"Benevolence · Off-field: Tap Skill for a roaming Cryo Crown; use the support Burst to increase Stellar Glimmer damage while another carry attacks.\nGlory · On-field: Hold Skill to fight with Cryo spear attacks. Her alternate Burst and Sealing mechanic reward planned field time.\nCryo Team Flex: Use her off-field Crown alongside a Cryo carry. Her value outside Glimmer teams still needs release testing.","n":4},"seo":{"roles":["DPS / Support"],"about":"Anastasya switches between two Cryo playstyles. Tap Skill summons an off-field Azure Star Crown for Cryo hits and Stellar Glimmer support; Hold Skill gives her Cryo-infused spear attacks for on-field damage. Her Burst changes with her stance. Pre-release kit; details may change.","pros":["Two Cryo playstyles","Off-field Cryo hits","Stellar Glimmer buffs","On-field damage option"],"cons":["Stance timing matters","Variable kit in beta","Sealing affects swaps","Rankings untested"],"weapons":["Silverdawn","The First Great Magic","Aqua Simulacra","Polar Star","Jade Vista","Breezeborne Refrain","King's Squire","Windblume Ode"],"arts":[{"sets":["Heart of the Furnace"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Reaction Support"},{"sets":["Disenchantment in Deep Shadow"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Reaction DPS"},{"sets":["Gladiator's Finale","Shimenawa's Reminiscence"],"pcs":"2 + 2 pcs","role":"Temporary ATK Mix"}],"main":["ATK% / ER (provisional)","Cryo DMG / ATK% (TBD)","CR / CD (provisional)"],"stats":["Targets: Not confirmed","ER: Team-dependent","Main scaling: TBD"],"vars":[{"title":"Reaction Support (Preview)","role":"Provisional Support","weapons":["Breezeborne Refrain","King's Squire"],"arts":[{"sets":["Heart of the Furnace"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ER and reaction needs first; exact scaling is unconfirmed.","teams":"A qualifying Stellar reaction and a confirmed way for Anastasya to trigger it.","when":"Concept only, for teams that can use her reaction utility if it is confirmed at release.","cond":"Do not treat as a verified build or ranking.","notes":"Pre-release concept. Signature Silverdawn remains in Studio and is not altered by this import.","pre":true},{"title":"On-field Cryo (Preview)","role":"Provisional DPS","weapons":["Aqua Simulacra","Polar Star"],"arts":[{"sets":["Disenchantment in Deep Shadow"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Gladiator's Finale","Shimenawa's Reminiscence"],"pcs":"2 + 2 pcs"}],"stats":"CRIT / ATK / ER are tentative; check final talent scaling.","teams":"Teammates must accommodate on-field time and provide suitable buffs.","when":"Planning-only build for a possible on-field Cryo damage role.","cond":"Artifact effects must work with released combat mechanics.","notes":"Pre-release concept, not damage-tested.","pre":true},{"title":"Benevolence · Off-field","role":"Off-field Cryo Support","weapons":["Breezeborne Refrain","King's Squire"],"arts":[{"sets":["Heart of the Furnace"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ER and reaction needs first; exact scaling is unconfirmed.","teams":"An on-field carry; Electro or Cryo Swirl enablers for Stellar Glimmer.","when":"Tap Skill to summon the Cryo Crown, then swap to a carry. Her support Burst improves the party’s Stellar Glimmer damage.","cond":"Burst, Crown uptime and Sealing follow the Benevolence stance","notes":"Leaked pre-release kit; exact scaling and equipment rankings may change.","pre":true},{"title":"Glory · On-field","role":"On-field Cryo DPS","weapons":["Aqua Simulacra","Polar Star"],"arts":[{"sets":["Disenchantment in Deep Shadow"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Gladiator's Finale","Shimenawa's Reminiscence"],"pcs":"2 + 2 pcs"}],"stats":"CRIT / ATK / ER are tentative; check final talent scaling.","teams":"Electro or Stellar Swirl enablers with buffs prepared before she takes the field.","when":"Hold Skill for Cryo spear attacks and use her Glory Burst for her personal damage sequence.","cond":"Glory Burst Seals teammates; set buffs before taking the field","notes":"Leaked pre-release kit; rotations and equipment rankings require live testing.","pre":true}],"mats":["Shivada Jade Sliver","Shivada Jade Fragment","Shivada Jade Chunk","Shivada Jade Gemstone","Shattered Stability Anchor","Teachings of Charity","Guide to Charity","Philosophies of Charity","Chimeric Core","Symbiotic Chimeric Nucleus","Prime Chimeric Nexus","Fairy Wormwood","Weekly Boss Material — TBD","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"The Dawn Beyond the Everwinter","pri":"TBD at release"},{"name":"Polestar’s Divine Judgment","pri":"TBD at release"},{"name":"To the New World","pri":"TBD at release"}],"teams":[{"name":"Royal Voltage","members":["Anastasya","Mitya","Odette","Danica"]},{"name":"Conducting Chaos","members":["Anastasya","Sandrone","Yae Miko","Danica"]},{"name":"Snowball Effect","members":["Anastasya","Vesna","Odette","Vodyanitsa"]},{"name":"Cold as Ice","members":["Anastasya","Wriothesley","Furina","Escoffier"]}]},"pv":true}],"title":"Anastasya","pv":true,"el":"Cryo"}